WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
One of two equal pieces is green. We call it one half. Watch where the green colour ends.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Imagine drawing a line through the middle of each big piece. We do not add or remove any green.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Now the whole has four equal pieces. Two are green. The green edge has stayed in exactly the same place.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Compare the strips. Same whole. Same green length. Different numbers: one half and two quarters.

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Cutting a piece into smaller parts changes the piece count. It does not change the amount you have.
